      "content": "hey, my knee is killing me today. ive had osteoarthritis for a while but it's flaring up really bad and i cant really walk normal. i am on eliquis for my afib so i have to be careful with stuff but i really need something for the swelling and pain. can i just take some ibuprofen to help with the inflammation? how much is okay to take?",
